   <p>Beyond standard paperwork, safeguarding your vehicle with 100% declared-value marine transit insurance is non-negotiable. Unlike basic coverage, this specialized policy guarantees full financial compensation matching your vehicle’s exact market value, regardless of damage, theft, or transit accidents. Marine transit insurance is specifically engineered for automotive logistics, covering door-to-door movement across rail, road, and multimodal networks.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">When booking your shipment, always verify that the insurer is IRDAI-recognized and that the policy explicitly states total declared-value protection.</p>
